---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components"
---

<section>
  <div class="relative h-166 md:h-dvh">
    <div class="relative z-10 container h-full">
      <div
        class="mx-auto flex h-full max-w-4xl flex-col justify-between gap-10 text-white"
      >
        <div class="basis-1"></div>
        <div class="basis-1"></div>
        <h1
          class="heading mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center text-hero text-balance"
        >
          Gestiona el <strong class="text-primary">Agua</strong> a tu Manera.
        </h1>
        <div
          class="flex h-20 max-w-4xl items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-full bg-white p-1.5 text-primary-foreground"
        >
          <span class="pl-4 font-light text-balance"
            >Solicitar Diagnóstico Técnico
          </span>
          <a
            class="flex h-full items-center rounded-full border border-foreground bg-primary-accent p-5 font-normal"
            href="#"
          >
            Agenda una cita
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="basis-1"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 right-0 z-0 overflow-hidden">
      <video
        class="relative size-full object-cover"
        width={1920}
        height={1080}
        controls={false}
        autoplay
        muted
        loop
        playsinline
        disablepictureinpicture
        controlslist="nodownload noplaybackrate"
      >
        <source src="/video/lobby-hero.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      </video>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div></div>

<section class="">
  <div
    class="container flex flex-col justify-between gap-y-24 pt-12 sm:pt-20 md:pt-30 lg:flex-row lg:pt-40 xl:pt-50"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 lg:max-w-md xl:pt-24">
      <div>
        <h2
          class="max-w-xs text-5xl leading-[0.9] font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-balance text-primary md:max-w-sm md:text-7xl"
        >
          Soluciones que Fluyen como Agua.
        </h2>
        <Icon name="underline" class="mt-1 h-auto w-60 md:mt-1.5 md:w-80" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-lg text-balance text-primary-foreground">
        Tratamiento, reutilización, optimización o control total, no importa
        cómo sea tu operación. Entendemos que cada industria tiene necesidades
        únicas. Nuestra misión es ayudar a más empresas a transformar el agua en
        un recurso estratégico, con soluciones adaptadas a cada proceso.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="relative flex w-full justify-end lg:w-3/5">
      <Icon
        name="illustration-container"
        class="absolute -top-15 right-0 h-auto w-3/5 xl:-top-20 xl:-right-10"
      />
      <div
        class="z-10 aspect-square w-full bg-[url(/images/tanks.webp)] mask-[url(../icons/image-blob.svg)] bg-cover bg-top-left bg-no-repeat mask-no-repeat"
      >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
